abstract: >
  Open research workbench for surface-antigen and radioligand (theranostics)
  target intelligence: knowledge graph, expression evidence, and AI-assisted
  querying. CD46 α-RLT is the first published case study.
keywords:
  - theranostics
  - radioligand therapy
  - knowledge graph
  - oncology
  - Open Targets
  - Neo4j
